@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Modified version notice
+
+This is a modified copy of FUTO Keyboard (https://github.com/futo-org/android-keyboard).
+It was modified to add "Rasi mode", a toolbar toggle that swaps keys with their partner
+symbols/numbers. All original FUTO licensing, copyright and payment-related notices and
+functionality are kept. See LICENSE.md. Distributed free of charge, non-commercially.
